                      (value (:boxed "GValue" "g_value_get_type" gobject:value)))
                     :return :boolean :url
                     "https://docs.gtk.org/gtk4/method.TreeDragDest.row_drop_possible.html"
                     :documentation
                     "Determines whether a drop is possible before the given DEST-PATH,
at the same depth as DEST-PATH. i.e., can we drop the data in
VALUE at that location. DEST-PATH does not have to
exist; the return value will almost certainly be NIL if the
parent of DEST-PATH doesn’t exist, though.

Returns a boolean.

C: gtk_tree_drag_dest_row_drop_possible
See: https://docs.gtk.org/gtk4/method.TreeDragDest.row_drop_possible.html
Deprecated.")


